{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485333,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T12:59:11.327Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485333-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485333-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"1:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor IDE\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"2:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Cursor CLI\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"3:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Background Agent (GitHub, Slack, Web, Linear)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box fa fa-square-o\" data-chk-src=\"4:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e BugBot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"5:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Somewhere else: Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485333-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485333-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Grok Bot iOS, re-authorizing the Todoist connector opened \u003ca href=\"http://app.todoist.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eapp.todoist.com\u003c/a\u003e and showed JSON: error invalid_request, error_description “code_challenge is required for public clients”. Retrying the same reconnect immediately afterward succeeded. Intermittent first-attempt OAuth/PKCE failure on the official Todoist plugin.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485333-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485333-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOn Grok Bot iOS, open a Todoist connector that needs re-auth.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStart authorize / reconnect (webview to \u003ca href=\"http://app.todoist.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eapp.todoist.com\u003c/a\u003e).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve the JSON error about missing code_challenge.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClose and try again — second attempt completed successfully.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485333-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485333-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe connect-card OAuth request always includes PKCE code_challenge so Todoist accepts the first attempt.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485333-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485333-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/4/f46a5b057dce687b19eed21552a14619b4dd4820.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/yScmQyfn3zaeTh0K64Ax6tvDPtS.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"todoist-oauth-code-challenge.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/4/f46a5b057dce687b19eed21552a14619b4dd4820_2_690x424.jpeg\" alt=\"todoist-oauth-code-challenge.jpeg\" data-base62-sha1=\"yScmQyfn3zaeTh0K64Ax6tvDPtS\" width=\"690\" height=\"424\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/4/f46a5b057dce687b19eed21552a14619b4dd4820_2_690x424.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/f/4/f46a5b057dce687b19eed21552a14619b4dd4820_2_1035x636.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/f/4/f4